{"date":"2025-12-11","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_96463ec9f7ea1d65b604e949ae6fe5d5","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1765445400,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-12-08","chunk":0,"id":"m_46f9eaa74197d1b1c7561111b34baacf"}}},{"id":"m_daad36d2b87908ad2cd41aeb8c0ecf70","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1765445437,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8a70c633e7c44bd307ae581ffead3f2c","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1765445474,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c6c17f7aff9f442aece5783e4a6a4e54","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1765445511,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c4e84a0544bf4b00344d14f458653b7a","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1765445548,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_229e1853ac3722501f143c0c4fb1d371","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1765445585,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8546c4c96b19ef1c1dd511a9626ff5f2","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1765445622,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_988ed1a411d4186dc2f65dc430fc29db","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1765445659,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_776263d56a6157a74fec80b5ddad014e","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1765445696,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2872a687073d67c0fe7b67135d0c79fd","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1765445733,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_49a791a581d58862342f48f5a5ace1aa","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1765445770,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_3d2e693ac123a6eb5ed9c430267acf11","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1765445807,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_380c09084e654b761537a31b02737135","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1765445844,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dd3e61bb6e15c2c1395edfc01b0f693c","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1765445881,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_234763f4d2c7ac0259b3a7a07f3c9874","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1765445918,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_bfb49bd094b0aa2523057bda8c46eefa","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1765445955,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_b78d5296ae68d64c2175e862ee2b2a13","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1765445992,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dead6fbd03fdb0ed6c544b84ef5191e6","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1765446029,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_68af59b7641284085a74cd9bcfad9e3c","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1765446066,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f612ebe4f05fc3f56e9f37c1f17cf76d","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1765446103,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_af6d6348b2db7ea60c1f0816fb4c1d60","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1765446140,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_da7ea3ded6354c5bb572e70c0b6555e0","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1765446177,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_10724a407f6ad1425592d12784bf5f84","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1765446214,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1c2be2a95a43598d34d6d62d455e2e7d","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1765446251,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
